message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below."
title: "AlpacaVision: Data Integrity in Vision-Language Auto-Labelling Pipelines"
abstract: >-
  An open, curated, leakage-free alpaca (Vicugna pacos) detection dataset from the
  Peruvian Altiplano, a compact YOLOv11n detector (mAP@0.5 = 0.860), a reproducible
  data-integrity methodology for auto-labelling pipelines, and an honest negative
  result on vision-language auto-labelled ocular anomaly classification.
